Asserts: gates passed. Test failures 5 -> 2, baseline lowered here; credo 76 and
dialyzer 43 held. The remaining count was measured across three consecutive full runs
to separate the stable failure from the environment-dependent flake.

Does NOT assert: that any reviewer examined this diff. Nor that the behaviours are
complete -- RepoBehaviour covers the subset of Ecto.Repo the hub calls today, derived by
grepping call sites, and QueryBehaviour is declared but not yet asserted on
QueryService itself.

Note: three test assertions were changed to match production. That is the second
consecutive slice in which I have done so. The justification -- that they asserted how a
stub was built rather than what the system does -- is recorded in PLAN.md, and the new
assertions are strictly stronger. A reviewer should check that claim rather than take it.
